"""FluoroAnts Universal 2.12.0: single-file launcher (a Python script, not an EXE).

Double-click to start.  The complete program (app.py + fluoro_ants package)
is embedded below as a base85-encoded zip archive.  On first start it is
unpacked once into a per-user cache folder keyed by the archive's SHA-256, so
later starts reuse the unpacked files (and Python's bytecode cache) instead of
extracting them again.  When that cache is already in place the embedded
archive is not even decoded: the launcher only checks the cache marker and
starts the program.  If the cache cannot be used for any reason, the launcher
unpacks into a temporary folder that is removed when the program exits.

Requires Python 3.10 or later with NumPy, OpenCV, SciPy and PySide6.  The
program works offline; nothing is downloaded or sent.
"""

